---
const WORKS_WITH = 'Python · TypeScript · JavaScript · Java · C · React · Node.js · Expo · Supabase · Tailwind · AWS (Lambda, DynamoDB, EC2, S3) · Docker · Linux · Bash · Git · ML / PyTorch';
const DOES = 'Machine learning & data science · Scalable, deployable systems · Full-stack web · Mobile';
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <span class="sec-index">01</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">About Me</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img src="/profile-placeholder.jpg" alt="Antiraedus" class="profile-img" />
      </div>

      <div class="about-text">
        <p class="about-lede">Hello! To put simply, I like romanticising life.</p>

        <p>
            I enjoy learning about systems, deconstructing and understanding every aspect and component of them, to learn from and build better world models. I am a generalist learner; I do not believe people are so weak as to only need to 'specialise' in one thing. Perhaps to be world leading you must, but, is it really that impossible to be <b> great </b> at many things instead? I think not.
        </p>

                <p>
                    I've made full-stack web applications, data science projects and machine learning models (see projects). More importantly, I've made Nudge (open-source app blocker because I hate trillion-dollar companies changing your attention to become a better consumer). Also currently writing <em>The Pursuit of Ambition</em>.
        </p>
        <p>
            Interested in building things that improve human agency, designing systems, space, astronomy, neuroscience, and artificial intelligence. Also hiking and experiencing experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
            I am also extremely interested in increasing human agency and the future of the world -- see <a href="https://github.com/astraedus" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@astraedus</a> for some projects I've worked on.
        </p>

        <div class="about-facts">
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">Works with</span>
            <p class="fact-line">{WORKS_WITH}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="fact">
            <span class="fact-label">Does</span>
            <p class="fact-line">{DOES}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-alt);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: var(--container);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  /* ---- Editorial section header (shared primitive) ---- */
  .sec-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr;
    gap: 0 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .sec-index {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .sec-title {
    grid-column: 2;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  /* ---- Two columns: photo + prose ---- */
  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-image {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .profile-img {
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    /* 1px hairline ring held 6px off the photo */
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--color-bg-alt), 0 0 0 7px var(--color-rule);
  }

  /* ---- Prose ---- */
  .about-text {
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }

  .about-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.6vw, 1.6rem);
    line-height: 1.35;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }

  .about-text p {
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .about-text b {
    color: var(--color-heading);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-text em {
    color: var(--color-heading);
  }

  .about-text a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .about-text a:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ---- Quiet "Works with" / "Does" block ---- */
  .about-facts {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .fact-label {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .fact-line {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-text-alt);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  /* ---- Responsive ---- */
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .container {
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
    }

    .profile-img {
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
    }
  }
</style>
